n   Since Dave is furry, Point 11 directly applies: **Dave must be green**. No conflicting rules exist. Even if his quietness or size is unknown, the premise "furry → green" holds universally.\n\n4. **Additional Checks:**.\n   - Point 14 states "All green people are big," but this doesn’t negate Dave’s greenness—it only adds a constraint if he’s green (which he is).\n   - Dave’s lack of niceness doesn’t affect his color, as niceness isn’t linked to greenness in the provided rules. Therefore, my final option is: ']] 16%|#6        | 96/600 [20:12<44:23,  5.29s/it]  
