act 5) is compatible with being blue because \"smart \u2192 nice\" (rule 15) does not force Fiona to be smart unless she is kind, which is not established here.\n\nSince there is no rule that explicitly allows or forbids Fiona from being blue, and the information provided does not determine her color definitively, the answer is unknown.\n\n\\boxed{C}",
