ite), nice, and young, satisfying this rule.\n3. **Rule 1**: All kind, big things are blue. Harry is not stated to be kind, so this rule does not apply to him.\n4. No other rules conflict with Harry being white. \n\nNo contradictions exist between Harry\u2019s stated attributes and the rules. Thus, the statement \"Harry is white\" is explicitly confirmed in the context. \n\n**Answer: A) True**",
